        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFour bed semi-detached\n\nBUN AN CHNOIC, MOYCULLEN NEW HOMES\n\nA stunning collection of high-quality A-Rated 3 and 4-bedroom homes coming to Bun an Chnoic, Moycullen, Co. Galway.\n\nThis exceptional development offers a selection of terraced, semi-detached and detached homes, ranging from approximately 110 sqm to 140 sqm, thoughtfully designed for modern family living.\n\nEach home combines timber-frame construction, contemporary design and high-quality finishes, with features including energy-efficient heating, modern kitchens, private gardens and landscaped open spaces.\n\nIdeally located in the heart of Moycullen, residents can enjoy the charm and convenience of village life while being just approximately 15 minutes from Galway City.\n\nA beautiful setting, excellent connectivity and quality new homes — the perfect place to call home.\n\nRegister your interest now for priority access to Phase 1 homes, pricing and availability."
